SUMMARY:Personalized Nutrition Initiative Innovation Day 2026
DESCRIPTION:PN Innovation Day is the Personalized Nutrition Initiative's 
 annual meeting bringing together university researchers and external par
 tners around personalized nutrition research\, with a call for abstracts
 . The 2026 edition runs September 28 to 30\, 2026 at the Illini Union\, 
 including a clinical research facility tour and welcome dinner\, the mai
 n programming day\, and an external partners program meeting.\n\nDeadlin
 es\nAbstract submission deadline: 2026-08-24\n\nhttps://personalizednutr
 ition.research.illinois.edu/2026-pn-innovation-day/
LOCATION:Urbana\, Illinois\, Illini Union\, University of Illinois Urbana
 -Champaign
URL:https://personalizednutrition.research.illinois.edu/2026-pn-innovatio
 n-day/
