SUMMARY:MDS International Congress of Parkinson's Disease and Movement Di
 sorders 2026
DESCRIPTION:The International Congress of Parkinson's Disease and Movemen
 t Disorders is the annual scientific meeting of the International Parkin
 son and Movement Disorder Society\, covering research and clinical care 
 in Parkinson's disease and other movement disorders. The 2026 congress i
 s scheduled for October 4 to 8\, 2026\, at the COEX Convention and Exhib
 ition Center in Seoul\, South Korea\, and has not yet concluded as of Se
 ptember 10\, 2026.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission opens: 2025-12-15\n
 Abstract submission deadline: 2026-03-15\n\nhttps://www.mdscongress.org/
LOCATION:Seoul\, KR\, COEX Convention and Exhibition Center
URL:https://www.mdscongress.org/
